# Bulky regenerable logs from repair-benchmark rounds; the durable evidence
# (model.fr, VALIDATION_REPORT.md, REPAIR_HISTORY.md, codex_notes.md) is kept.
**/repair*/round*/compile.log
**/repair*/round*/mg5.log
**/repair*/round*/codex_stdout.txt
# Reverse-check agent stdout/stderr and regenerable TeX-fix intermediates.
**/review/*_stdout.txt
**/review/*_stderr.txt
**/review/*_texfixed.md
